  16:     - The foreground is split into one or more 4-connected red objects.
  17:     - Pink is absent from the input and is used only for selected output objects.
  18: 
  19:     Rule
  20:     - Preserve black background pixels and red objects with area one, two, or three.
  21:     - Recolor every 4-connected red object with area at least four to pink.
  22: 
  23:     Key insight
  24:     - The changed objects are exactly the connected red objects that are large
  25:       enough; their position and shape do not otherwise matter.
